    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been having this really intense, throbbing headache all morning and it's making it impossible to work. i have a history of gastric ulcers so my doctor has me on omeprazole every day to keep things stable, but this pain is different. can i just take a really strong dose of ibuprofen or maybe even some aspirin to knock this out? i really don't want to go to the ER if i can just handle it at home with something strong.",
